      "message": "SFF-8436 and SFF-8636 are QSFP / QSFP28 management specifications rather than SFP. Lumping them under an enum named SFP is ambiguous when mapping to Redfish or when inspecting QSFP modules. \nShould we distinguish them according to the specification standards (e.g. SFF8472, SFF8436, SFF8636, or match Redfish ManagementInterfaceType enum values)?",
